'''Athlitikos Omilos Ayia Napa''' ({{langx|el|Αθλητικός Όμιλος Αγία Νάπα}}, Athletic Club Ayia Napa) is a [[Cyprus|Cypriot]] football club from the town of [[Ayia Napa]]. The club was founded in 1990 after the merger of two clubs: [[APEAN Ayia Napa|APEAN]] (''Athlitiki Podosfairiki Enosis Ayias Napas''; "Athletic Football Union of Ayia Napa") and [[ENAN Ayia Napa|ENAN]] (''Enosis Neon Ayias Napas''; "Youth Union Ayia Napa")."}}
